  "contracts": [
    "Detached raw skill declarations preserve examples, tags, security, modes and extensions; explicit FromTool conversion matches Python metadata mapping.",
    "Card discovery does not invoke a hidden agent factory; explicit skill omission uses the TypeScript empty list.",
    "Application version0.0.1; Native protocol0.3/configured modes, explicit TypeScript protocol0.2/textplain and Python protocol0.3/legacytext profiles. Profiles affect discovery defaults only.",
    "Atomic detached public card replacement validates required shape, duplicate fields/skill IDs, runtime capabilities, configured MIME support and supported JSONRPC interfaces.",
    "Optional provider/security/OAuth/extensions/signatures retain wire casing with structural validation; security enforcement and signature cryptographic verification remain host responsibilities.",
    "Public/private cards charge bounded raw and serialized UTF8 including escaped Unicode; invalid updates retain the previous card.",
    "Private card and explicit authorization callback must pair; false returns403, missing private card returns32007, valid no-params JSONRPC requests preserve correlation.",
    "Authorization reads preserve caller cancellation, are canceled/drained on shutdown and reject self-disposal/recursive-read cycles; borrowed callbacks are not disposed.",
    "Unknown JSONRPC methods without params correctly return32601; backend failures are sanitized32603.",
    "All prior task-store durability and stable native-pause recovery contracts remain covered by the consolidated family tests."
  ],
